# Level-appropriate loot with a zone ceiling (m2-affix-loot task 4.8, owner 2026-11-22). Needs Arpgtest online.
# Northshire (zone 6170; its quests - the range source - are filed under area 9 "Northshire Valley", range 1-5) and
# Arpg.Loot.ZoneCeilingMargin 15: loot level there = min(level, 20).
# Item 2317 = Dark Leather Tunic (green leather chest, requires 15).

# Level 20 in Northshire: loot level 20; the tunic (15) is within the 5-level gap -> kept.
> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 20 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
~ 4000
> .arpg loot substitute Arpgtest 2317
? kept item=2317 req=15 zone=\d+ area=\d+ \(close enough to loot level 20\)

# Level 60 in Northshire: still loot level 20 (zone ceiling) -> the tunic is kept: farming here stops paying.
# Level 60 one zone over (Westfall, range 10-18 -> ceiling 33): swapped for a green leather chest of level 28-33, never higher.
> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 60 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
~ 4000
> .arpg loot substitute Arpgtest 2317
? kept item=2317 req=15 .*\(close enough to loot level 20\)
> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 60 westfall-sentinelhill
? ok .*\(online\)
~ 6000
> .arpg loot substitute Arpgtest 2317
? substitute item=2317 req=15 -> item=\d+ req=(2[89]|3[0-3]) quality=2 .*\(loot level 33\)
> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 60 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
~ 6000

# Affix values follow the same loot level: a level-60 character's epic in Northshire rolls level-20 tiers (T2 max).
> .arpg test clearbags Arpgtest
? ok
> .arpg test give Arpgtest 82437
? quality=4
> .arpg loot last Arpgtest
! T[3-5]=

# Not equipment / not a drop candidate: kept.
> .arpg loot substitute Arpgtest 6948
? kept item=6948
